; ⚠️ GENERATED BY tools/gen_regions.py FROM tools/region_spec_celestial.py. Edit the spec.
;
; ====================================================================================================
; THE CELESTIAL REALM (the finish run, Act IV)
; ====================================================================================================
;
; The ruined realm of the dead gods. The story gate in the Sunspire library lets out on a raised
; landing at the south-west; the road climbs two broken concourse terraces north-east, crosses the
; void rift on the one bridge left standing and meets the Ashen Knight at the gate beyond it. The
; Ash Throne stands on the highest dais at the north of the realm. East and west, the terraces
; fall away into void. Nine cells, six of them nothing but broken ground and the view down.
;
; NO NEIGHBOUR IN, NO FAST TRAVEL IN. Nothing lists this region as a neighbour; the Sunspire library's
; story portal (owned by the main line) is the only way here. UnlockFlagId is still set, so any
; future door into the realm is gated on the same flag without a code change.

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Environment_celestial"]
script = ExtResource("3_environment")
Biome = ExtResource("20_biome_celestialruin")
SurfaceColor = Color(0.36, 0.33, 0.34, 1)
SecondaryColor = Color(0.24, 0.21, 0.22, 1)
